WEBVTT

00:19.528 --> 00:24.651
The living room is quiet The carpet's soft and

00:24.711 --> 00:32.516
warm Just staring at the CRT before the storm was

00:32.576 --> 00:39.480
born A flash of blinding purple A crackle in the

00:41.181 --> 00:46.714
air The glass just opened up And swallowed us in

00:46.754 --> 00:50.637
there Static and pixels Falling through the

00:50.657 --> 00:53.899
screen Into a digital nightmare A twisted

00:53.980 --> 00:57.162
glowing dream The smell of burning ozone The

00:57.242 --> 01:00.445
heavy basement air I'm holding on to you But

01:01.005 --> 01:06.410
you're not really there Static and pixels

01:06.430 --> 01:12.695
Static

01:12.915 --> 01:13.775
pixels

01:37.528 --> 01:42.490
The scrying terminal's broken, wires on the

01:42.630 --> 01:49.332
floor I hear the heavy footsteps coming down the

01:49.412 --> 01:50.813
corridor

01:52.853 --> 01:57.255
You're reading from the parchment A dark and

01:57.315 --> 02:04.157
cursed light I've got to find a way To get us

02:04.217 --> 02:08.359
through the night Static and pixel bowling

02:08.419 --> 02:11.260
Through the screen into a digital nightmare A

02:11.580 --> 02:14.341
twisted glowing dream The smell of burning

02:14.441 --> 02:18.122
ozone The heavy basement air I'm holding on to

02:18.182 --> 02:23.380
you But you're not really there Static and

02:23.441 --> 02:24.084
pixels.

02:53.897 --> 03:01.943
They think they can erase us All over I go But I got

03:02.003 --> 03:09.329
more than magic Hidden in my love Just hold on to

03:09.649 --> 03:09.870
me

03:16.151 --> 03:17.815
STAY EXCEL!

